<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 25.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 25.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on October 24.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   RIC	 Yield     Close</p>
<p>1  Villa World	     10.28     1.07</p>
<p>2  Prime Credit Tr	 10.21     0.96</p>
